                        Benedictine cathedral priory of Holy Trinity or Christ Church</orgName><p>Cancelled ex libris of Whalley abbey fol. 1v. Pledged in Oxford
                        loan chests in 1455, 1457, 1465, 1473. 'Liber magistri Thome Dryffeld qui
                        debet dompno Roberto Estry monacho ecclesie cristi Cant'' (fol. 1v).
                        Dryffeld and Eastry, monk of Christ Church (Greatrex, Register, 147), were
                        both at Oxford in 1474--6 and it seems possible that the book came to him as
                        part payment of the debt.</p></provenance>
